Package: inklow
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Inklow contributors <noreply@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Description: Local-first predictive typing for X11 desktops
 Private writing assistance with frozen Python, Qt and AT-SPI bindings.
 Supports Ubuntu 24.04+ and Debian 13+ amd64 X11 desktop sessions.
 Requires an AVX2, FMA and F16C capable CPU. Wayland global typing is not
 supported. Model weights are not included; downloads are explicit.
 User settings, model caches and writing history are never package-owned.
